{"seq":5,"slug":"influence-and-legacy","title":"王阳明·influence-and-legacy","stage":"DONE","category":"wang-yangming","categoryLabel":"王阳明","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/influence-and-legacy","rating":{"composite":3.78,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/24_wang-yangming/5_influence-and-legacy","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"王阳明-影响与遗产\">王阳明·影响与遗产</h1><p>本 hub 追溯王阳明心学在他身后五百年间「历久弥新、跨越国界」的影响轨迹：从明代弟子结成的<a href=\"the-yangming-school/disciples-and-branches\">阳明学派</a>，到传入<a href=\"influence-in-east-asia/yangming-in-japan\">日本</a>、影响幕末维新，到激励梁启超、孙中山等<a href=\"influence-in-east-asia/modern-reformers\">近代中国</a>思想家，再到<a href=\"enduring-relevance/mind-and-action-today\">当代价值</a>与<a href=\"enduring-relevance/global-interest\">走向世界</a>的全球关注。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-关注什么-vs-兄弟-hub\">本 hub 关注什么（vs 兄弟 hub）</h2><p>本系列共六个 hub，分工如下——本 hub 只论「身后的影响与流传」，不重复展开学说本身：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>兄弟 hub</th>\n<th>关注</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>王阳明一生事迹</td>\n<td>影响的「发出者」背景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>心学、知行合一、致良知的确立</td>\n<td>被传播的「思想内核」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>良知、工夫论的义理细节</td>\n<td>学说本义，本 hub 只引用不展开</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">主要著作</a></td>\n<td>《传习录》《大学问》四句教</td>\n<td>被译介、被传承的「文本」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>影响与遗产（本 hub）</strong></td>\n<td><strong>学派传承·东亚传播·近代复兴·当代世界</strong></td>\n<td><strong>身后五百年的流变</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>与朱子之辩、狂禅之讥、整体功过</td>\n<td>影响中的「负面/争议」面</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"前置与推荐学习路径\">前置与推荐学习路径</h2><p><strong>前置知识</strong>：阅读本 hub 前，建议先掌握<a href=\"../core-contributions/unity-of-knowing-and-acting/the-doctrine\">知行合一的学说</a>与<a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/liangzhi/the-innate-moral-knowing\">良知：内在的道德知</a>——本 hub 各篇频繁引用这两个核心概念而不再展开。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐路径</strong>（由源及流、由古及今）：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;前置:知行合一+致良知&lt;br/&gt;(2/3 号 hub)&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;1. 弟子与流派&lt;br/&gt;学派如何形成&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;2. 泰州学派&lt;br/&gt;最激进的一支&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;3. 阳明学在日本&lt;br/&gt;东亚传播&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;4. 近代的影响&lt;br/&gt;梁启超·孙中山&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;5. 当代价值&lt;br/&gt;知行合一今用&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;6. 走向世界&lt;br/&gt;全球关注&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"前置:知行合一+致良知&lt;br/&gt;(2/3 号 hub)\"] --&gt; B[\"1. 弟子与流派&lt;br/&gt;学派如何形成\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"2. 泰州学派&lt;br/&gt;最激进的一支\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"3. 阳明学在日本&lt;br/&gt;东亚传播\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"4. 近代的影响&lt;br/&gt;梁启超·孙中山\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"5. 当代价值&lt;br/&gt;知行合一今用\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"6. 走向世界&lt;br/&gt;全球关注\"]</pre><ul>\n<li>想了解<strong>学派传承</strong>：读<a href=\"the-yangming-school/disciples-and-branches\">弟子与流派</a> → <a href=\"the-yangming-school/the-taizhou-school\">泰州学派</a>。</li>\n<li>想了解<strong>国际影响</strong>：读<a href=\"influence-in-east-asia/yangming-in-japan\">阳明学在日本</a> → <a href=\"enduring-relevance/global-interest\">走向世界的心学</a>。</li>\n<li>想了解<strong>现实意义</strong>：读<a href=\"influence-in-east-asia/modern-reformers\">近代的影响</a> → <a href=\"enduring-relevance/mind-and-action-today\">知行合一的当代价值</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>阅读时请留意：阳明学的影响兼具解放与争议两面，对其末流之弊与近代政治挪用的衡估，参见<a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a>。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-yangming-school","title":"The Yangming School","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/influence-and-legacy/the-yangming-school","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"disciples-and-branches","title":"弟子与流派","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/influence-and-legacy/the-yangming-school/disciples-and-branches"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-taizhou-school","title":"泰州学派","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/influence-and-legacy/the-yangming-school/the-taizhou-school"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"influence-in-east-asia","title":"Influence In East Asia","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/influence-and-legacy/influence-in-east-asia","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"yangming-in-japan","title":"阳明学在日本","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/influence-and-legacy/influence-in-east-asia/yangming-in-japan"},{"seq":2,"slug":"modern-reformers","title":"近代的影响","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/influence-and-legacy/influence-in-east-asia/modern-reformers"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"enduring-relevance","title":"Enduring Relevance","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/influence-and-legacy/enduring-relevance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mind-and-action-today","title":"知行合一的当代价值","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/influence-and-legacy/enduring-relevance/mind-and-action-today"},{"seq":2,"slug":"global-interest","title":"走向世界的心学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/influence-and-legacy/enduring-relevance/global-interest"}]}]}